  "account": "破局书屋",
  "source_title": "情商高会说话永远都招人喜欢！#职场",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 226.020998,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "王铁王铁领导，我叫王毅，不叫王铁，你要是能摆五十下，我倒立洗头。外公听说有公积金的人都很厉害，你一个月公积金多少啊？傻孩子，外公就是普通岗位，跟普通人一样，才七千，那也不多嘛。好了，跟爸爸回家喽，走了回家了，你爸爸你怎么说啊，你为什么不叫同学一起收拾呢？既然我不打算再邀请他们来家里玩，我何必再得罪他一次呢？这小子才七岁，一个暑假去了潮汕老家，看来外公教的不错啊。你这个能掰多少个，也就五十个吧。你要是能摆五十下，我倒立洗头，一二三四十八、四十九。你说的对我确实掰不动了。王铁王铁领导，我叫王毅，不叫王铁，对不起，领导，是我不小心把名字打错了，这种小毛病下次再犯就卷铺盖走人，这个项目你来负责，合同金额上千万别让我失望。明白，我一定做好陈总啊，这是您托我买的酒，找到零钱，我给您放桌上了，您忙，我先回去了，客户那边已经确认了，过来签正式合同。好，我马上过去。白公，我昨天刚谈了一个项目，一下子提成了三十万，我要不要请同事们吃个饭呢？免得他们眼红说闲话，不如请客户去五星级搓澡，说不定他一开心呢，又给你介绍几个客户，提成三十万又到手了，请同事人走茶凉，不如结交贵人，平步青云小既是聚集卧室馆了。怎么样？经公司研究决定，从今天开始，由小张担任部门经理，谢谢领导。我马上就要离职了，你从读大学的时候就跟其他同学不一样，你到底是怎么做到的？才两个月就升经理了。从小外公就让让我看这本书，这本书以前是上位者的枕边书。如今也被一一拆解了。你看啊一定要培养自己，不接别人话的能力。听别人讲话的时候呢，先思考一下，不要别人问什么，你就答什么。别人越是催你的时候呢，越是要缓一缓，这就是高手跟普通人的差距。它不同于传统的书籍，随便打开一页，就像开了一扇心窗。他把普通人接触不到，和上层人心照不宣的生存法则呈现在你的面前，让你站在前人智慧的肩膀上去看问题。他不会教你做圣人，而是教你做棋手二零二六年。如果你想换一种活法，想在人际、职场、社交关系中更游刃有余，那一定要读一读这本书。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00001",
      "start_ms": 70,
      "end_ms": 2350,
      "text": "王铁王铁领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2630,
      "end_ms": 3410,
      "text": "我叫王毅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3530,
      "end_ms": 4375,
      "text": "不叫王铁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7330,
      "end_ms": 8410,
      "text": "你要是能摆五十下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8570,
      "end_ms": 9695,
      "text": "我倒立洗头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00006",
      "start_ms": 12690,
      "end_ms": 15750,
      "text": "外公听说有公积金的人都很厉害，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00007",
      "start_ms": 15870,
      "end_ms": 17350,
      "text": "你一个月公积金多少啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00008",
      "start_ms": 17530,
      "end_ms": 18190,
      "text": "傻孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00009",
      "start_ms": 18270,
      "end_ms": 19610,
      "text": "外公就是普通岗位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00010",
      "start_ms": 19770,
      "end_ms": 20770,
      "text": "跟普通人一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00011",
      "start_ms": 20770,
      "end_ms": 21350,
      "text": "才七千，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00012",
      "start_ms": 21750,
      "end_ms": 22770,
      "text": "那也不多嘛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00013",
      "start_ms": 23190,
      "end_ms": 23490,
      "text": "好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00014",
      "start_ms": 23490,
      "end_ms": 24330,
      "text": "跟爸爸回家喽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00015",
      "start_ms": 24950,
      "end_ms": 25795,
      "text": "走了回家了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00016",
      "start_ms": 27620,
      "end_ms": 32070,
      "text": "你爸爸你怎么说啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00017",
      "start_ms": 36400,
      "end_ms": 38220,
      "text": "你为什么不叫同学一起收拾呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00018",
      "start_ms": 38700,
      "end_ms": 41500,
      "text": "既然我不打算再邀请他们来家里玩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00019",
      "start_ms": 41820,
      "end_ms": 43580,
      "text": "我何必再得罪他一次呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00020",
      "start_ms": 44600,
      "end_ms": 45780,
      "text": "这小子才七岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00021",
      "start_ms": 46360,
      "end_ms": 48120,
      "text": "一个暑假去了潮汕老家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00022",
      "start_ms": 48680,
      "end_ms": 50305,
      "text": "看来外公教的不错啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00023",
      "start_ms": 64030,
      "end_ms": 65170,
      "text": "你这个能掰多少个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00024",
      "start_ms": 65710,
      "end_ms": 66835,
      "text": "也就五十个吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00025",
      "start_ms": 69960,
      "end_ms": 71040,
      "text": "你要是能摆五十下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00026",
      "start_ms": 71200,
      "end_ms": 72295,
      "text": "我倒立洗头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00027",
      "start_ms": 78790,
      "end_ms": 83610,
      "text": "一二三四十八、四十九。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00028",
      "start_ms": 87090,
      "end_ms": 89215,
      "text": "你说的对我确实掰不动了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00029",
      "start_ms": 92590,
      "end_ms": 94970,
      "text": "王铁王铁领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00030",
      "start_ms": 95230,
      "end_ms": 95970,
      "text": "我叫王毅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00031",
      "start_ms": 96130,
      "end_ms": 96965,
      "text": "不叫王铁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00032",
      "start_ms": 101840,
      "end_ms": 102200,
      "text": "对不起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00033",
      "start_ms": 102200,
      "end_ms": 102540,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00034",
      "start_ms": 102640,
      "end_ms": 104155,
      "text": "是我不小心把名字打错了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00035",
      "start_ms": 106220,
      "end_ms": 108420,
      "text": "这种小毛病下次再犯就卷铺盖走人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00036",
      "start_ms": 108840,
      "end_ms": 110020,
      "text": "这个项目你来负责，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00037",
      "start_ms": 110380,
      "end_ms": 112580,
      "text": "合同金额上千万别让我失望。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00038",
      "start_ms": 112880,
      "end_ms": 113300,
      "text": "明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00039",
      "start_ms": 113300,
      "end_ms": 121330,
      "text": "我一定做好陈总啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00040",
      "start_ms": 121610,
      "end_ms": 122770,
      "text": "这是您托我买的酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00041",
      "start_ms": 123250,
      "end_ms": 123950,
      "text": "找到零钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00042",
      "start_ms": 124130,
      "end_ms": 125150,
      "text": "我给您放桌上了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00043",
      "start_ms": 125490,
      "end_ms": 125930,
      "text": "您忙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00044",
      "start_ms": 125950,
      "end_ms": 126690,
      "text": "我先回去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00045",
      "start_ms": 129970,
      "end_ms": 131210,
      "text": "客户那边已经确认了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00046",
      "start_ms": 131210,
      "end_ms": 131950,
      "text": "过来签正式合同。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00047",
      "start_ms": 131950,
      "end_ms": 132190,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00048",
      "start_ms": 132250,
      "end_ms": 133055,
      "text": "我马上过去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00049",
      "start_ms": 137800,
      "end_ms": 138220,
      "text": "白公，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00050",
      "start_ms": 138540,
      "end_ms": 139860,
      "text": "我昨天刚谈了一个项目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00051",
      "start_ms": 139860,
      "end_ms": 141020,
      "text": "一下子提成了三十万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00052",
      "start_ms": 141080,
      "end_ms": 142560,
      "text": "我要不要请同事们吃个饭呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00053",
      "start_ms": 142680,
      "end_ms": 143940,
      "text": "免得他们眼红说闲话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00054",
      "start_ms": 144520,
      "end_ms": 146700,
      "text": "不如请客户去五星级搓澡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00055",
      "start_ms": 147120,
      "end_ms": 148420,
      "text": "说不定他一开心呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00056",
      "start_ms": 148520,
      "end_ms": 149860,
      "text": "又给你介绍几个客户，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00057",
      "start_ms": 150180,
      "end_ms": 151840,
      "text": "提成三十万又到手了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00058",
      "start_ms": 152300,
      "end_ms": 154100,
      "text": "请同事人走茶凉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00059",
      "start_ms": 154520,
      "end_ms": 155900,
      "text": "不如结交贵人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00060",
      "start_ms": 156600,
      "end_ms": 160940,
      "text": "平步青云小既是聚集卧室馆了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00061",
      "start_ms": 161060,
      "end_ms": 161685,
      "text": "怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00062",
      "start_ms": 165880,
      "end_ms": 167260,
      "text": "经公司研究决定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00063",
      "start_ms": 167480,
      "end_ms": 168440,
      "text": "从今天开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00064",
      "start_ms": 168740,
      "end_ms": 170755,
      "text": "由小张担任部门经理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00065",
      "start_ms": 173100,
      "end_ms": 173740,
      "text": "谢谢领导。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00066",
      "start_ms": 175520,
      "end_ms": 176620,
      "text": "我马上就要离职了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00067",
      "start_ms": 176880,
      "end_ms": 179100,
      "text": "你从读大学的时候就跟其他同学不一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00068",
      "start_ms": 179460,
      "end_ms": 180640,
      "text": "你到底是怎么做到的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00069",
      "start_ms": 180740,
      "end_ms": 182615,
      "text": "才两个月就升经理了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00070",
      "start_ms": 185000,
      "end_ms": 186795,
      "text": "从小外公就让让我看这本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00071",
      "start_ms": 187390,
      "end_ms": 189390,
      "text": "这本书以前是上位者的枕边书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00072",
      "start_ms": 189690,
      "end_ms": 191195,
      "text": "如今也被一一拆解了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00073",
      "start_ms": 191640,
      "end_ms": 193590,
      "text": "你看啊一定要培养自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00074",
      "start_ms": 193590,
      "end_ms": 194775,
      "text": "不接别人话的能力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00075",
      "start_ms": 195080,
      "end_ms": 196320,
      "text": "听别人讲话的时候呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00076",
      "start_ms": 196320,
      "end_ms": 197120,
      "text": "先思考一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00077",
      "start_ms": 197200,
      "end_ms": 198080,
      "text": "不要别人问什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00078",
      "start_ms": 198080,
      "end_ms": 198900,
      "text": "你就答什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00079",
      "start_ms": 198980,
      "end_ms": 200500,
      "text": "别人越是催你的时候呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00080",
      "start_ms": 200560,
      "end_ms": 201575,
      "text": "越是要缓一缓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00081",
      "start_ms": 201830,
      "end_ms": 203575,
      "text": "这就是高手跟普通人的差距。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00082",
      "start_ms": 203830,
      "end_ms": 205175,
      "text": "它不同于传统的书籍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00083",
      "start_ms": 205450,
      "end_ms": 206390,
      "text": "随便打开一页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00084",
      "start_ms": 206390,
      "end_ms": 207595,
      "text": "就像开了一扇心窗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00085",
      "start_ms": 207890,
      "end_ms": 209230,
      "text": "他把普通人接触不到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00086",
      "start_ms": 209430,
      "end_ms": 212845,
      "text": "和上层人心照不宣的生存法则呈现在你的面前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00087",
      "start_ms": 213090,
      "end_ms": 215525,
      "text": "让你站在前人智慧的肩膀上去看问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00088",
      "start_ms": 215780,
      "end_ms": 216880,
      "text": "他不会教你做圣人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b48dbbef32c8eadc_s00089",
      "start_ms": 216960,
      "end_ms": 219350,
      "text": "而是教你做棋手二零二六年。"
